graph LR
    LLP["llm-d-latency-predictor<br/>(Prediction + Training Servers)"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    LLP -->|"latency predictions<br/>HTTP 8001/TCP"| RoutingLayer["llm-d Routing Layer<br/>(Consumer)"]
    RoutingLayer -->|"training data<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP"| LLP

    %% Python ML Dependencies (Required)
    LLP -->|ML framework| ScikitLearn["scikit-learn 1.9.0<br/>(BayesianRidge, StandardScaler)"]
    LLP -->|data processing| Pandas["pandas 3.0.3"]
    LLP -->|numerics| NumPy["numpy 2.5.0"]
    LLP -->|statistics| SciPy["scipy 1.18.0"]
    LLP -->|model serialization| Joblib["joblib 1.5.3"]

    %% Python ML Dependencies (Optional model backends)
    LLP -.->|primary model backend| XGBoost["XGBoost 3.3.0<br/>(quantile/mean regression)"]
    LLP -.->|alt model backend| LightGBM["LightGBM 4.6.0<br/>(native categorical support)"]

    %% Python Web Dependencies (Required)
    LLP -->|REST framework| FastAPI["FastAPI 0.138.1"]
    LLP -->|ASGI server| Uvicorn["uvicorn 0.49.0<br/>(multi-worker)"]
    LLP -->|validation| Pydantic["pydantic 2.13.4"]
    LLP -->|HTTP client| Requests["requests 2.34.2"]

    %% Python Performance Dependencies (Optional)
    LLP -.->|fast JSON| ORJSON["orjson 3.11.9<br/>(bulk endpoint fast path)"]

    %% Monitoring
    Prometheus["Prometheus"] -->|"scrapes /metrics<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP"| LLP

    %% Infrastructure
    LLP -->|model storage| PVC["PVC<br/>(Persistent Volume)"]
    LLP -->|container base| AIPCC["AIPCC cpu:3.5.0<br/>(UBI9 base image)"]

    %% Styling
    style LLP fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px,color:#fff
    style RoutingLayer fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style Prometheus fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333

    %% Required deps
    style ScikitLearn fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Pandas fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style NumPy fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style SciPy fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Joblib fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style FastAPI fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Uvicorn fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Pydantic fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Requests fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff

    %% Optional deps (dashed)
    style XGBoost fill:#bbb,stroke:#333,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style LightGBM fill:#bbb,stroke:#333,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style ORJSON fill:#bbb,stroke:#333,stroke-dasharray: 5 5

    %% Infrastructure
    style PVC fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style AIPCC fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
